# Test Conventions

- **Framework:** pytest + pytest-cov. Target 80%+ coverage.
- **Location:** all tests under `tests/`, mirroring the source layout being tested.
- **Run:** `uv run pytest` (all), `uv run pytest --cov=src` (with coverage),
  `uv run pytest -k "test_parse"` (targeted).
- Every test needs at least one assertion that would actually fail if the code under test broke —
  no assertion-free smoke tests.
- Do not mock the component under test. If a test needs the real `DataSourceFactory`-backed data
  source to be meaningful, use it — don't fake the thing you're trying to verify.
- Do not silence a failing test with `@pytest.mark.skip`; either fix it or flag the bug it's
  revealing.
